# Passkey login for the Hermes dashboard (hermes.DOMAIN) through Pocket ID.
# Copy to config/hermes/dashboard-oidc.env, fill in the two lines below, then ./stack.sh up.
# If the file is absent, compose skips it and the dashboard keeps using basic auth.
#
# In Pocket ID (id.DOMAIN) -> OIDC Clients -> Add:
#   - Name: hermes-dashboard
#   - Public client: ON (Hermes uses PKCE, there is no client secret)
#   - Callback URL: https://hermes.DOMAIN/auth/callback
#   - Allowed User Groups: admins
HERMES_DASHBOARD_OIDC_ISSUER=https://id.DOMAIN
HERMES_DASHBOARD_OIDC_CLIENT_ID=
# HERMES_DASHBOARD_OIDC_SCOPES=openid profile email
